    "body": "Hi,\n\nHere is what I have from the owner on Hillside Ct.\n\nThe property is in Boulder, zip 80302. It is not held in a trust. The insured's date of birth is November 2, 1979. Medical payments at 1,000 is fine. There are no animals on the property. The house sits on a slab foundation and has two stories. The roof is standing seam metal with a gable shape. The electrical panel is 200 amps and the plumbing is about 12 years old. The fire department is 2.5 miles from the house.\n\nOne correction on the vacancy: the owner tells me the house was empty for 5 consecutive months, not 3. He was overseas for work from January through the end of May and the house sat unoccupied the whole time.\n\nBest,\nJordan Reyes\nFront Range Insurance Group\n"
